        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "The value of the entire farm bill outweighs individual components in importance.",
        "confidence": 0.88
      },
      {
        "text": "Legislators have a moral responsibility to deliver tangible outcomes.",
        "confidence": 0.87
      },
      {
        "text": "Compromise reflects pragmatism rather than weakness in political leadership.",
