        "text": "The availability of credit from rural electric co-ops played a key role in enabling project implementation.",
        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "Funding challenges typically prevent the launch of new programs without external support.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "Credit from rural electric co-ops is considered a reliable or trustworthy source of financing.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
