        "text": "We had a situation with a cushion of credit.",
        "confidence": 0.95
      },
      {
        "text": "We chose to collaborate with these entities rather than impose restrictions.",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "Consolidating programs led to cost savings.",
