    "turn_text": "Thinking about the regional differences, I think it was Chairman Conway who wanted to look at some of those base acres that had been unplanted for a number of years and shift those dollars around. Some would have said that would have caused some controversy in regional differences in the bill. How did you see your way through that and did that help you accomplish some other areas?",
