    "turn_text": "I think that's a step where from a policy standpoint, it may not go into effect for the next three or four years, but down the road, I think it could be very helpful given whatever we face the 214 bill. a different situation with high prices. Basically, it was a house provision. We thought from a policy standpoint down the road that that would be another, as you call, a portion of flexibility. And I think that really goes into the safety net should the situation change dramatically. I will predict, I think, more farmers will go into the POC program because of the price situation as opposed to farmers going into the art program back in 2014 where prices were higher.",
