    "turn_text": "And they're thankful that the crop insurance provisions are protected, that Title I is in place. But their conversation also lends to catastrophe that has become more the norm as late. And the President of all wondered aloud, if it wasn't prudent for the country to have an acceptable or at least a standard reaction to such catastrophe, whether wildflowers or hurricanes or floods.",
