    "turn_text": "And certainly a credit to you and other leaders to be able to take policy by partisan by camera and see it approved with such a majority. Now I know that Congressman Peterson will assume the chairmanship of the House Agriculture Committee in 2019 and he said one of his priorities is to oversee the regulatory process of USDA implementing the bill. Do you see a need to watch over the USDA closely?",
