    "turn_idx": 27,
    "turn_text": "I don't know about watching over but working with the USDA certainly. That will be a primary objective. I know Colin feels very strongly about that. I've known Colin for years saying that his ban is called First Amendment. And why I got up there and why he invited me to sing is beyond comprehension. I think everybody after about 30 seconds knew that that was a bad deal. But I did. I know Colin, he's easy to work with. He's very plain spoken. He'll let you know exactly where he stands. All of the snow, Mike, Colin, and Endeavour myself, we do have an obligation to work with the Department of Agriculture. More especially the FSA in the implementation of this bill. Did we get it right? Is there something that we could fix? There's always a good hard look at a new farm bill. You may have a technical correction or two, but that will be our obligation. and responsibilities.",
