    "turn_idx": 28,
    "turn_text": "I noted that inside the policy, a couple of areas, I won't say a bureaucracy, but that fall under a hood of now an individual that would oversee and look into food waste. And also, this bill tells the Secretary of Agriculture to come up with an Under Secretary for Rural Development.",
